As shown in the figure, hyperbola $y = \frac{k}{x}$ (where $x > 0$) passes through vertex $A$ of triangle $OAB$ and midpoint $C$ of $OB$, and $AB$ is parallel to the $x$-axis. The coordinates of point $A$ are $(2,3)$.

(1) Determine the value of $k$;

(2) If point $D(3,m)$ is on the hyperbola, find the analytical expression of straight line $AD$;

(3) Calculate the area of $\bigtriangleup OAB$.

