A telecommunications company offers two types of local mobile communication services, A and B. Users of type A need to pay a monthly fee of 15 yuan, and then pay 0.3 yuan per minute of talk time; users of type B pay no monthly fee, and pay 0.6 yuan per minute of talk time. If the talk time in a month is $x$ minutes, the costs of types A and B are $y_{1}$ and $y_{2}$ yuan respectively.

(1) Write the function relationship expressions between $y_{1}, y_{2}$ and $x$ respectively;

(2) Draw the graphs of $y_{1}$ and $y_{2}$ in the same coordinate system;

(3) According to the talk time in a month, which communication service do you think is more favorable?

