A certain region is rich in electric power resources, which have been well developed. In order to encourage residents to use electricity, a local power supply company adopts a piecewise billing method to calculate electricity bills. The function graph between monthly electricity consumption $x$ (kWh) and corresponding electricity fee $y$ (yuan) is shown in the figure.

(1) When the monthly electricity consumption is 100 kWh, the electricity fee payable is ______ yuan;

(2) When $x \geq 100$, find the function relationship expression between $y$ and $x$;

(3) When the monthly electricity consumption is 260 kWh, how much electricity fee should be paid?

